      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个是餐馆休业而去便利店解决午饭时照的照\r\n片！这里卖的商品都特别有地域特色，我学到\r\n了不少东西哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "936fbd1ab1c6737060778d13e1401ab45fd816007b3dd86c86ec7123b7914e94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
